fmtone2.fmb is the FM voice bank named by eup_test.eup (header offset 0x6E2), from Modland (Euphony/Aya/Mondschein/fmtone2.fmb), taken 2026-11-05 from https://modland.com/pub/modules/Euphony/Aya/Mondschein/fmtone2.fmb. Modland states no licence; the voices belong to their author. Used unchanged, only as an eup-decode test fixture (rows I701, I1127).
